# Пакет: путь события целиком — харнес запустил отдельный процесс, обёртка привела
# событие к каноническому, decide() отработала, след лёг в ТОТ ЖЕ журнал решений,
# что пишут JS-хуки, и метрики его увидели. Пилот ничего не решает намеренно:
# он меряет путь, а не содержимое вызова.
{"name": "пакет отвечает на своём событии и кладёт след", "hook": "trace-probe", "expect": ["silent", "file-contains:\"hook\":\"trace-probe\",\"outcome\":\"none\""], "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}}
{"name": "ключ следа — идентификатор вызова, а не номер процесса", "hook": "trace-probe", "expect": "file-contains:\"key\":\"toolu_pkg\",\"sid\":\"pkg-sid\",\"call_id\":\"toolu_pkg\",\"event\":\"post-tool\"", "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}}
{"name": "ключ события БЕЗ идентификатора вызова — хеш его байтов", "hook": "trace-probe", "expect": "file-contains:\"key\":\"3e4fb11b4f8c7a6d\"", "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {}, "tool_response": {}}}
{"name": "чужое событие — пакет молчит и следа не оставляет", "hook": "trace-probe", "expect": ["silent", "file-empty"], "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "Stop", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "cwd": "/tmp"}}
{"name": "mode через modules.toml гасит пакет", "hook": "trace-probe", "expect": ["silent", "file-empty"], "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}", "XDG_CONFIG_HOME": "{TMPHOME}/config"}, "seed": {"{TMPHOME}/config/jarvis/modules.toml": "[modules]\ntrace-probe = \"off\"\n"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}}
{"name": "mode через переменную гасит пакет — она старше конфига", "hook": "trace-probe", "expect": ["silent", "file-empty"], "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}", "JARVIS_MODULES_OFF": "trace-probe", "XDG_CONFIG_HOME": "{TMPHOME}/config"}, "seed": {"{TMPHOME}/config/jarvis/modules.toml": "[modules]\ntrace-probe = \"on\"\n"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}}
{"name": "конфиг включает пакет, которого нет в переменной, — переменная не гасит остальных", "hook": "trace-probe", "expect": ["silent", "file-contains:\"hook\":\"trace-probe\""], "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}", "JARVIS_MODULES_OFF": "какой-то-другой-модуль"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}}
{"name": "нет python3 — строка регистрации молчит и следа не оставляет", "hook": "trace-probe", "shell": true, "expect": ["silent", "file-empty"], "env": {"PATH": "{TMPHOME}/нет-такого-каталога", "ASSERT_FILE": "{DECISIONS}"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}, "exit": 127}
{"name": "след пакета сшивается со сводкой: ключ у записи вызова и у следа ОДИН", "hook": "dispatch", "setup": ["dispatch", "trace-probe"], "setup_input": [{"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}, {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}], "expect": ["file-contains:\"key\":\"toolu_pkg\",\"tool\":\"Bash\",\"id\":\"toolu_pkg\"", "file-contains:\"hook\":\"trace-probe\""], "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{METRICS}", "CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID": "pkg-sid"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "Stop", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "cwd": "/tmp"}}
{"name": "след JS-хука сшивается по-прежнему, пока рядом работает пакет", "hook": "dispatch", "setup": ["dispatch", "trace-probe", "dispatch"], "setup_input": [{"hook_event_name": "PreToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_sleep", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "sleep 30"}, "cwd": "/tmp"}, {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}, {"hook_event_name": "Stop", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "cwd": "/tmp"}], "expect": ["file-contains:\"denies\":{\"total\":1,\"by_class\":{\"sleep-waiter-guard\":1}}", "file-contains:\"unknown_events\":0"], "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{METRICS}", "CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID": "pkg-sid"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "SessionEnd", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "cwd": "/tmp", "reason": "clear"}}
{"name": "нет python3 — остальная цепочка события цела: JS-хуки пишут своё", "hook": "dispatch", "expect": "file-contains:\"kind\":\"post\",\"ts\":", "env": {"ASSERT_FILE": "{METRICS}", "CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID": "pkg-sid", "PATH": "{TMPHOME}/нет-такого-каталога"}, "input": {"hook_event_name": "PostToolUse", "session_id": "pkg-sid", "tool_use_id": "toolu_pkg", "tool_name": "Bash", "tool_input": {"command": "ls"}, "cwd": "/tmp", "tool_response": {"ok": true}}}
